ompare/1.99.55-ls5...1.99.55-ls6","upstream":"Release v1.99.55 (Chromium 157.0.8103.39)\n\n# Android\n\nPick the `APK` suitable for your device's architecture.\n\n# iOS\n\n`brave-core-ios-1.99.55.*` contains Brave for iOS.\n\n# Linux\n\n`DEB` and `RPM` packages attached below, details at https://brave.com/linux\n\n# macOS\n\n`Brave-*-*.dmg` or `Brave-*-*.pkg` will install this version.\nmacOS 12 and above are supported as per https://support.brave.app/hc/en-us/articles/360021357112-What-are-the-system-requirements-to-install-Brave\n\n# Windows\n\n`Brave*Setup.exe` will fetch and install the latest available version for your CPU architecture from our update servers.\nWindows 10 and above are supported as per https://support.brave.app/hc/en-us/articles/360021357112-What-are-the-system-requirements-to-install-Brave\n\n# Release Notes\n\n### Leo\n\n - Improved Leo to present a list of choices when it needs clarification on a task. ([#59649](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/59649))\n - Improved suggested follow-up prompts. ([#59650](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/59650))\n - Updated AI Chat models. ([#59701](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/59701))\n - Fixed issue where a compromised Leo conversation frame could approve AI Chat tool-use requests without a direct user action. ([#59703](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/59703))\n\n### General\n\n - Re-enabled \"Allow split view drag-and-drop on left or right edge of window\" setting under brave://settings/braveContent. ([#49752](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/49752))\n - Updated icon in URL bar to magnifying glass for Brave Search. ([#58178](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/58178))\n - Upgraded Chromium to 157.0.8103.39. ([#60882](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/60882)) ([Changelog for 157.0.8103.39](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/156.0.8078.80..157.0.8103.39?pretty=fuller&n=1000))\n\n# Origin Release Notes\n\n - Re-enabled \"Allow split view drag-and-drop on left or right edge of window\" setting under brave://settings/braveContent. ([#49752](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/49752))\n - Updated icon in URL bar to magnifying glass for Brave Search. ([#58178](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/58178))\n - Upgraded Chromium to 157.0.8103.39. ([#60882](https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/issues/60882)) ([Changelog for 157.0.8103.39](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/156.0.8078.80..157.0.8103.39?pretty=fuller&n=1000))","upstream_url":"https://github.com/brave/brave-browser/releases/tag/v1.99.55"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/config","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","DISPLAY=:1","PERL5LIB=/usr/local/bin","START_DOCKER=true","PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/defaults","SELKIES_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_input_interposer.so","SELKIES_WEBCAM_INTERPOSER=/usr/lib/selkies_v4l2_interposer.so","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all","DISABLE_DRI3=false","SELKIES_ENCODER=h264enc,h265enc,vp8enc,vp9enc,av1enc,jpeg","SELKIES_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTH=false","SELKIES_VIDEO_STREAMING_MODE=false","SELKIES_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*","SELKIES_RATE_CONTROL_MODE=crf,cbr","SHELL=/bin/bash","__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK=0","TITLE=Brave","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","PIXELFLUX_WAYLAND=true","NO_DECOR=true"],"exposed_ports":["3000/tcp","3001/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/brave/builds/1.99.55-ls6.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/brave/builds/1.99.55-ls6/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/brave/builds/1.99.55-ls6/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.githu